  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nIf (52416)/(168)=312 \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(52416)/(168)=312 \n\n⇒ (52.416)/(0.0168)\n\n⇒ (52416/1000)/(168/10000)\n\n⇒ (52416/1000) × (10000/168)\n\n⇒ (52416 / 168) × 10\n\n⇒ 312 × 10\n\n⇒ 3120\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
